WEBVTT

00:04:27.388 --> 00:04:31.809
so we'd have more courage and less fear

00:04:31.809 --> 00:04:35.062
when dealing with
uncomfortable situations.

00:04:35.688 --> 00:04:39.108
So that meant zero coddling.

00:04:39.984 --> 00:04:43.321
Put your comfort away, she'd preach.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:48.743
Any challenge that arose
was an opportunity to find your sea legs.

00:04:48.743 --> 00:04:53.706
Next up, confidence comes from character,

00:04:53.748 --> 00:04:55.958
not our looks.

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.878
Cheryl was a giant buzzkill.

00:04:59.879 --> 00:05:03.507
When she noticed me
glancing in the mirror as a kid,